[standards/technology/nextjs/STD-TEC-NXT-001-coding.md#24-type-importsexports]

### 2.4 Type Imports/Exports

-   Group type imports separately from value imports
-   Export types and interfaces from dedicated type files when they're used across multiple components

```typescript
// Imports
import { useState, useEffect } from 'react';
import type { AppProps } from 'next/app';
import { useRouter } from 'next/router';
import type { User, AuthStatus } from '@/types/auth';

// Component code...
```

