[standards/technology/nextjs/STD-TEC-NXT-001-coding.md#32-props-design]

### 3.2 Props Design

-   Use explicit prop interface definitions
-   Destructure props in the function parameter
-   Provide default values where appropriate
-   Use optional props with `?` notation when they're truly optional

```typescript
interface CardProps {
    title: string;
    description?: string;
    imageSrc?: string;
    onClick?: () => void;
    variant?: 'default' | 'compact' | 'expanded';
}

export default function Card({
    title,
    description = '',
    imageSrc,
    onClick,
    variant = 'default',
}: CardProps) {
    // Component code
}
```

